+---
+type: fix
+issue: 8795
+jira: SMILE-13077
+title: "Previously, an auto-versioned reference such as `Patient/123` was saved without a version if the
+  Patient's entry in the same transaction had a placeholder `fullUrl` such as `urn:uuid:...`. This has been
+  fixed."
